General => General / 常规设置

framerate => Change your FPS cap / Update刷新率上限
drawFramerate => Sets the maximum draw frame rate independently from the update rate / 绘制帧数的上限，请与update上限区分
language => Change engine language / 切换语言
lockRender => Will update separate from the draw update, the effect is to increase the number of frames by about two to three times (depending on device performance) / 将update和draw的更新分开，效果就是帧数提升大约两到三倍（取决于设备性能）
renderThread => Separating the rendering thread improves frame rates / 渲染线程分离提升画面帧数
gameQuality => Change game quality for screen / 更改屏幕的游戏画面质量
lowQuality => Turn off some object on stages / 低质量模式
resolution => The resolution of the game graphics / 游戏画面的分辨率
colorblindMode => Colorblind filter more playable for colorblind people / 色盲滤镜模式
antialiasing => Toggle antialiasing, improving graphics quality at a slight performance penalty / 使用抗锯齿，提高图形质量，但性能略有下降
flashing => Toggle flashing lights that can cause epileptic seizures and strain / 允许可能导致引发癫痫的特效使用
shaders => Shaders used for some visual effects / 启用着色器
cacheOnGPU => Allows the GPU to be used for caching textures, decreasing RAM usage / 允许将 GPU 用于缓存纹理，从而减少 RAM 使用率
autoPause => Stops game, when its unfocused / 当游戏未在前台时自动停止游戏
replayQuality => Records per-note hit data for more accurate replays. Uses more memory and disk space. / 记录每个音符的判定数据以获得更准确的回放。会占用更多内存和磁盘空间。
gcFreeZone => Suspend most of the RAM cleaning to reduce sudden lag during gameplay and solve the problem of memory leakage crashes caused by excessive RAM usage. / 暂停大部分运存清理以减少游玩时突然的卡顿和解决因运存过高导致的清理内存泄漏崩溃问题

autoShaderConversion => Automatically converts desktop OpenFL shaders to the OpenGL ES version supported by this mobile device / 在手机上自动将桌面 OpenFL 着色器转换为当前设备支持的 OpenGL ES 版本
mouseTrailEffect => Enables pointer trails and click effects; both are hidden automatically in PlayState / 启用鼠标或触摸指针的星星拖尾与点击特效；进入 PlayState 后会自动隐藏
